Z||000011||West Coast Fiero||12-22-2001||06:17 AM||||Ok - have something here... Recently Mike Murphy ( the recipient of a 3800 II turbocharged application ) had his 87 GT dynoed, I do not have the slip unfortunately ( Chris wanted me to tell you guys the info, I declined as I knew there would be speculation as I do not have the slip to scan and post, however I'll tell anyways per Chris' request - dad's always right )I do not have the slip but here are the numbers....<P><B>298HP @ 4800RPM</B><BR>I do not have the torque numbers but I will be calling Mike to get the numbers directly from him<P>here is the link to see the buildup of his car.... <A HREF="http://clubs.hemmings.com/fieroswest/WCFpage01.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://clubs.hemmings.com/fieroswest/WCFpage01.htm</A> <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://clubs.hemmings.com/fieroswest/WestCoast300.gif"> <BR>Eric Nelson<BR>Technician,<BR>West Coast Fiero<BR>www.cwestco.com<BR>310-305-4111||||reg||1
